## Python Instruction
Write a function to check if two given sentences are anagrams of each other. An anagram is a word or phrase formed by rearranging the letters of a different word or phrase, typically using all the original letters exactly once.

## Python Solution
```python
def are_anagrams(str1, str2):
    if len(str1) != len(str2):
        return False
    return sorted(str1) == sorted(str2)
```

