## Choosing PHASE — Credence runs 3 ordered rounds; pick by the INPUT's parse/compile status
- syntax   — `before` WON'T PARSE (Sourceror fails); fixes raw text. e.g. `n*(n+1) div 2` → `div(n*(n+1), 2)`.
